      "note": "`ChallengeTlv::GetChallengeLength()` already clamps to `sizeof(mChallenge)`, and the fixing diff changes this exact call site to use that accessor. Reusing `aChallenge.GetLength()` here is the missing size obligation that makes the later `memcpy()` read past stack local `challenge`.",
